---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Femine" description="The terms for using the Femine website and booking coaching sessions.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <PageHero eyebrow="Legal" title="Terms & Conditions" text="Last updated: 15 November 2026" crumb="Terms & Conditions" />
    <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
      <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 px-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted lg:px-8">
        <p>By using femine.pages.dev and booking a session with us, you agree to these terms. Please read them — they are written in plain language on purpose.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">1. What coaching is — and is not</h2>
        <p>Femine provides personal development coaching. It is not therapy, counselling, medical advice or legal advice. If you are facing a mental health crisis, please contact a licensed professional or a crisis helpline in your country.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">2. Sessions and bookings</h2>
        <p>Sessions last 60 minutes and take place online over video call, unless we agree otherwise. Your first 30-minute call is free. Paid sessions are booked after we agree on a plan together. You may reschedule free of charge up to 12 hours before a session starts; later changes may be charged.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">3. Prices and payment</h2>
        <p>Prices shown on this site are in Indian rupees (₹) and include all taxes. Prices may change, but a price agreed at booking will not change for that booking.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">4. Your responsibilities</h2>
        <p>Coaching works when you do. You are responsible for attending sessions on time, doing the agreed exercises between sessions, and telling us honestly when something is not working.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">5. Confidentiality</h2>
        <p>Everything you share in a session is confidential and will not be shared with anyone else, except where we are legally required to do so or where there is a serious risk of harm.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">6. Website content</h2>
        <p>The content on this site is general information, not personalised advice. You may share or link to it with credit, but you may not copy the site’s text, images or design and present them as your own.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">7. Liability</h2>
        <p>We work carefully and professionally, but we cannot guarantee specific results — your progress depends on your own effort and circumstances. To the extent permitted by law, our liability is limited to the fees you paid for the sessions in question.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">8. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. If you have a concern, please email hello@femine.pages.dev first — most problems are solved faster by talking.</p>
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
